    }}
  \end{minipage}\hfill
  \begin{minipage}[c]{0.32\linewidth}\centering
    \fcolorbox{primary!40}{bluebg}{\parbox{0.9\linewidth}{%
      \centering\vspace{10pt}%
      {\fontsize{48}{58}\selectfont\bfseries\color{primary} 1.2 Billion}\\[8pt]
      {\fontsize{24}{32}\selectfont\color{textdark} Youth Entering Workforce}\vspace{10pt}%
    }}
  \end{minipage}\hfill
  \begin{minipage}[c]{0.32\linewidth}\centering
    \fcolorbox{secondary!40}{bluebg}{\parbox{0.9\linewidth}{%
      \centering\vspace{10pt}%
      {\fontsize{48}{58}\selectfont\bfseries\color{secondary} 1.5 Billion}\\[8pt]
      {\fontsize{24}{32}\selectfont\color{textdark} Target Health Access}\vspace{10pt}%
    }}
  \end{minipage}
}

% ══ COLUMN 1 ══

\posterbox[darkcard, title={A Historic Recovery — But Uneven}
]{name=recovery, column=1, between=row5 and row9}{
  \fontsize{26}{36}\selectfont
  \begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Headline Resilience:} Post-2020 recovery is the \textbf{strongest in 6 decades}, exceeding expectations.
    \item \textbf{Widening Gap:} Vulnerable emerging market and developing economies (EMDEs) significantly lag advanced peers.
    \item \textbf{Near-term Outlook:} Global growth projected to edge downward due to firm inventory corrections and tariff effects.
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{16pt}
  \centering
  \colorbox{primary!15}{\parbox{0.9\linewidth}{
    \centering\vspace{8pt}
    \textbf{Core Tension:} Headline resilience masks vulnerabilities in economies left behind.\vspace{8pt}
  }}
}

\posterbox[redcard, title={Risks to the Outlook}
]{name=risks, column=1, between=row9 and row14}{
  \fontsize{26}{36}\selectfont
  \textbf{Downside risks dominate the near-term economic forecast:}
  \vspace{16pt}
  \begin{itemize}[itemsep=16pt]
    \item \textbf{Trade Tensions:} Escalating tariffs disrupt supply chains, dampen investment, and reduce growth.
    \item \textbf{Financial Volatility:} Deteriorating sentiment threatens to tighten EMDE financing conditions.
    \item \textbf{Inventory Correction:} Firms that front-loaded purchases are drawing down stocks.
    \item \textbf{Climate Shocks:} Extreme weather increasingly damages agricultural output and infrastructure.
  \end{itemize}
}

\posterbox[bluecard, title={Policy Actions for Sustained Growth}
]{name=policy, column=1, between=row14 and row20}{
  \fontsize{24}{32}\selectfont
  \textbf{Reform Areas \& Actions:}
  \vspace{12pt}
  \renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.8}
  \begin{tabular}{p{0.24\linewidth} p{0.66\linewidth}}
    \rowcolor{secondary!15}
    \textbf{Trade} & Improve multilateral system; Diversify partners/products \\
    \textbf{Finance} & Ease EMDE financing; Strengthen macro frameworks \\
    \rowcolor{secondary!15}
    \textbf{Climate} & Scale mitigation/adaptation; Build resilient infrastructure \\
    \textbf{Investment} & Catalyze private capital; Remove structural bottlenecks \\
    \rowcolor{secondary!15}
    \textbf{Jobs} & Support labor mobility; Enhance skills flexibility \\
  \end{tabular}
}

% ══ COLUMN 2 ══

\posterbox[darkcard, title={World Bank 2030 Strategic Priorities}
]{name=priorities, column=2, between=row5 and row14}{
  \fontsize{26}{36}\selectfont
  With \textbf{1.2 billion young people} reaching working age, job creation is the central mission.
  \vspace{20pt}

  \centering
  \colorbox{primary!12}{\parbox{0.95\linewidth}{
    \vspace{12pt}
    \begin{itemize}[itemsep=14pt]
      \item \textbf{Health Services:} Deliver quality, affordable care to \textbf{1.5 billion people}.
      \item \textbf{Mission 300:} Provide \textbf{300 million people} in Sub-Saharan Africa with electricity access.
      \item \textbf{AgriConnect:} Help \textbf{300 million farmers} move up the agricultural value chain.
      \item \textbf{Capital Support:} Access to capital for \textbf{80 million more women} and women-led businesses.
      \item \textbf{Water Forward:} Water security for \textbf{over 1 billion people} (\$400M commitment).
    \end{itemize}
    \vspace{12pt}
  }}
}

\posterbox[bluecard, title={Key Research Themes}
]{name=research, column=2, between=row14 and row18}{
  \fontsize{26}{36}\selectfont
  Rigorous analysis underpinning Bank recommendations:
  \vspace{16pt}
  \begin{itemize}[itemsep=16pt]
    \item \textbf{Fiscal Policy:} Rebuilding fiscal space (Jan '26); small state challenges (Jun '24).
    \item \textbf{Trade \& Supply Chains:} High trade costs (Jun '21); COVID-19 impact (Jun '20).
    \item \textbf{Commodity Markets:} Drivers of price cycles (Jan '22); energy implications (Jun '22).
    \item \textbf{Financial Spillovers:} Rising U.S. rates (Jun '23); rapid debt buildup (Jan '20).
  \end{itemize}
}

\posterbox[highlightcard, title={Conclusion \& Direction}
]{name=conclusion, column=2, between=row18 and row20}{
  \fontsize{26}{36}\selectfont
  \begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Growth remains unequal} without targeted policy intervention.
    \item Global cooperation on trade and climate is \textbf{imperative} for EMDE resilience.
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{8pt}
  \centering
  \textit{Full report and data available at worldbank.org/gep}
}

\end{tcbposter}
\end{document}

